    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="24.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 24.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ðæt nan cyping ne sy Sunnondagum; gif hit ðonne hwa dó, þolige ðæs ceapes ⁊ gesylle XXX scll' to wite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no trading shall take place on Sundays; and if anyone does so he shall lose the goods and pay a fine of 30 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And þæt nán ceaping ne sy Sunnandagum; gif hit hwa dó, ðolige ðæs ceapgyld ⁊ sylle XXX scill.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
